OL,3,GNEWSADrink-driver jailed after causing
OL,4,Arunner to lose leg
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding drink-driver who struck a
OL,7,Fwoman with his van, causing her leg to
OL,8,Fbe amputated, has been jailed.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said the victim,
OL,11,Fwho was a "high-performance athlete",
OL,12,Fwas sitting on a pavement while
OL,13,Frecovering from a run in Racecourse
OL,14,FRoad in Colwick on 27 February, when
OL,15,FKyle Waldram veered towards the
OL,16,Fopposite side of the road.
OL,18,FHe then clipped the kerb and struck the
OL,19,Fwoman, who was left with serious
OL,20,Finjuries to both of her legs and had to
OL,21,Fhave one amputated.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
