OL,3,GNEWSADrink-driver jailed after causing
OL,4,Arunner to lose leg
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaldram, 38, failed a breath test at
OL,7,Fthe scene, police said, and later
OL,8,Fpleaded guilty to causing serious
OL,9,Finjury by dangerous driving and driving
OL,10,Fwithout insurance. He was sentenced at
OL,11,FNottingham Crown Court on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
